// @check
// @error-at 5:3 postfix `++` target must be a name, a field or an element
// @error-at 7:3 postfix `--` target must be a name, a field or an element
// Postfix `++`/`--` on an operand that is no place (a call, a parenthesised value) gets the
// diagnostic and the operator is consumed, not left to re-parse as a prefix op.
(1)++
function f(): i32 { 1 }
f()--
